================================================================================
T-Head PPU (HGGC) additions
================================================================================

The hggc (PPU) portions of this project (the hggc csrc kernels, the
`csrc/.ppu_compat/` shim headers, the SM80-style csrc kernels, the
hgcc JIT build glue and PPU test/benchmark scripts) were developed by
T-Head (Shanghai) Semiconductor Co., Ltd. and is licensed under the
same MIT license as the rest of this project. These files carry a
`Copyright (c) 2026 T-Head (Shanghai) Semiconductor Co., Ltd.` header
with `SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT`.

