Changes to bundled / derived source
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The vendored third-party sources listed above are adapted for this
project's hggc (PPU) build: device code is written against the hggc
device/runtime API, and project-local symbols were renamed where
needed to avoid collisions. Every modified file carries a
`Copyright (c) 2026 T-Head (Shanghai) Semiconductor Co., Ltd.` line
above the preserved original copyright notice, as required by
Apache-2.0 §4(b). The original unmodified files
(`allocator.h`, `exception.h`, `mask.cuh`, `gather_tensor.hpp`,
`fmha_options.hpp`) retain their upstream headers verbatim (plus an
SPDX-License-Identifier tag where it was missing).

